          "top joints " + T.V.top + ", deck joints " + T.V.deck +
          "; S690 CHS per member sized by utilisation to 0.6 with frequency, sway and buckling guards.",
    nodes: T.nodes.map(n => ({ id: n.id, x: n.x, y: n.y, z: n.z, joint: n.joint })),
    joints: T.joints,
